{"id":105,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصْحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"أَلَمْ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَلْ كَيْدَهُمْ فِى تَضْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَأَرْسَلَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَيْرًا أَبَاب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"تَرْمِيه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ِم ب</span>ِحِجَارَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>ِجّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>لٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"فَجَعَلَهُمْ كَعَصْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">فٍ م</span>َّأْك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>لِۭ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"}]}